PART 1: DETAILED PROJECT ABSTRACT

1. Executive Summary
Project Title: Product Review Sentiment Analyzer with Purchase Intent Predictor
Project Type: Machine Learning & Natural Language Processing System
Domain: E-commerce Analytics, Customer Intelligence
Duration: 14 days (2 weeks)
Primary Objective: Develop an intelligent system that automatically analyzes thousands of product reviews to extract aspect-based sentiment insights 
and predict which customers are likely to return products, enabling data-driven product improvement decisions and proactive customer retention strategies.
Key Innovation: Unlike traditional sentiment analysis that provides binary positive/negative classifications, this system performs multi-dimensional 
analysis by identifying specific product aspects (battery, screen, price, quality) and computing sentiment for each aspect independently, while simultaneously 
predicting return intent based on linguistic patterns and review characteristics.

